<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 40px; }
      .header { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #1a1a1a; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .text { color: #4a5568; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .field { background: #f7f7f5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; }
      .field p { margin: 6px 0; color: #2d3748; font-size: 14px; }
      .label { font-weight: bold; color: #1a1a1a; }
      .message-box { background: #f7f7f5; border-left: 3px solid #1a1a1a; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; }
      .message-box p { color: #2d3748; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; white-space: pre-wrap; }
      .footer { text-align: center; color: #718096; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 32px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>Nouvelle soumission via formulaire de contact</div>
      <p class='text'>Un nouveau message a été soumis via le formulaire de contact.</p>
      <div class='field'>
        <p><span class='label'>Nom :</span> {{fullName}}</p>
        <p><span class='label'>E-mail :</span> <a href='mailto:{{email}}'>{{email}}</a></p>
        <p><span class='label'>Sujet :</span> {{subject}}</p>
      </div>
      <p class='text'><strong>Message :</strong></p>
      <div class='message-box'>
        <p>{{message}}</p>
      </div>
      <p class='text'>Répondez directement à l'expéditeur à <a href='mailto:{{email}}'>{{email}}</a>.</p>
      <div class='footer'>&copy; 2025 Oraculum Admin</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
